[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 13561.99, "timestamp": "03:46:01", "text": "屏幕一直黑屏。同样的事情"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13563.349, "timestamp": "03:46:03", "text": "这种情况也发生在我身上。我不知道为什么我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13577.99, "timestamp": "03:46:17", "text": "[音乐]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13583.189, "timestamp": "03:46:23", "text": "所以，你现在不紧张了吗？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13589.269, "timestamp": "03:46:29", "text": "是的，是给我自己用的。不，是……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13591.99, "timestamp": "03:46:31", "text": "一开始真的很像，而且"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13596.229, "timestamp": "03:46:36", "text": "人们好像都在看着我。没关系。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13598.15, "timestamp": "03:46:38", "text": "呃，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13600.63, "timestamp": "03:46:40", "text": "我们只是在放松。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13602.87, "timestamp": "03:46:42", "text": "还有闲逛。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13605.17, "timestamp": "03:46:45", "text": "我们只是闲逛而已。这一切都是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13613.429, "timestamp": "03:46:53", "text": "是的，因为 Joathon 太长了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13617.83, "timestamp": "03:46:57", "text": "现在我可以好好休息11个月了。"}]